<title>ESTONIA: UHISPANK TO RAISE 1997 PROFIT FORECAST.</title>
<headline>UHISPANK TO RAISE 1997 PROFIT FORECAST.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's second-largest bank Uhispank on Friday said that it expected to increase its 1997 profit forecast in August.</p>
<p>&quot;We will raise the profit forecast in August after the release of audited and consolidated first half results,&quot; bank vice-president Ulo Suurkask told a news conference.  </p>
<p>Uhispank's six month profit was 57.7 million kroons and its 1997 profit estimate is 105.8 million kroons.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
